{'symbol': 'GPS', 'date': '2021-11-23 16:15:00', 'title': 'GAP INC. REPORTS THIRD QUARTER RESULTS', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GAP INC. (NYSE: GPS), A PORTFOLIO OF PURPOSE-LED, BILLION-DOLLAR LIFESTYLE BRANDS INCLUDING OLD NAVY, GAP, BANANA REPUBLIC, AND ATHLETA, AND THE LARGEST SPECIALTY APPAREL COMPANY IN THE U.S., REPORTED A THIRD QUARTER FISCAL YEAR 2021 DILUTED LOSS PER SHARE OF $0.40. EXCLUDING FEES ASSOCIATED WITH RESTRUCTURING THE COMPANY'S LONG-TERM DEBT AND NET CHARGES RELATED TO STRATEGIC CHANGES IN ITS EUROPEAN OPERATING MODEL, ADJUSTED DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WERE $0.27."}